From 33e673b25ca626f9c45661827dd9678d7d71ae08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iori Yanokura <ab.ioryz@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:51:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] hw/intc: Add Renesas RA Interrupt Controller Unit (ICU)

The ICU of the Renesas RA family routes peripheral events (numbered as
in the ELC event table) to NVIC lines through the IELSRn registers. An
event latches the IR flag of every IELSR that selects it, and the NVIC
line follows IR until software writes IR=0, which the Renesas FSP does
at the start of every interrupt handler.
